{{Quote|Break it up, people. Better yet, let me break it up for you!|Armodrillo to [[Psyphon's Gang]].<ref name="TMTCP2">''[[The More Things Change: Part 2]]''</ref>}} 
'''Armodrillo''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Talpaedan]] from the planet [[Poiana Lüncas]]{{Refn|[[Poiana Lüncas]] was revealed to be Armodrillo's home planet in the fifty-third issue of the Cartoon Network Action Pack series, released on December 1, 2010.{{Refn|Issue #53; [[:File:Poiana Lüncas Lore.png|file]]|group = AP|name = Armo}} Despite this, on April 14, 2011, a user named [[User:Reece Philippe Villamonte|Reece Philippe Villamonte]] edited this page, claiming that Terraexcava was Armodrillo's home planet. The page for Terraexcava would later be created on April 30, 2011 by another user named [[User:Sillifactu|Sillifactu]], citing Bandai's website and fan site Ben10Toys.net as sources. Archived pages from the Bandai site do not seem to have any information regarding Armodrillo's home planet. Thus, Poiana Lüncas is the true name of Armodrillo's home planet.{{Refn|[[Ben 10 Planet:Longstanding Misinformation]]|group = BTP}}|group = note}} in the [[Andromeda (Classic)|Andromeda Galaxy]].

==Appearance==
===Ben as Armodrillo===
Armodrillo is a yellow ten-foot-tall alien<ref>[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]</ref><ref name="TToE">''[[The Transmogrification of Eunice]]''</ref> with an armored, mechanical robotic-like body. His head is similar to a Greek Corinthian helmet with two ears on it, giving him the appearance of an [[Wikipedia:Armadillo|armadillo]]. Armodrillo has a gray tail and jackhammer parts on his elbows, wrists and hands, creating the impression that he is a digging robot. Despite his mechanical and robotic-like appearance, all of these aspects are, in fact, biological and natural to his race. He also has blood that is grey and partially translucent.<ref name="AF">''[[Andreas' Fault]]''</ref>

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Armodrillo looks similar to his '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' appearance, but his ears are slightly longer, he has grey bolts with black markings on his shoulders and a metal circle on top of his head. His face has been restructured a little bit, his arm-drills are now much larger, and his feet are now yellow instead of grey while his toes remain grey. His fingers now have a small horizontal line design along with his tail and the black parts of his limbs, his arms, upper arms, and thighs are now more chain-like, and his forearms and shoulders are now much bulkier.

Armodrillo wears the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]/[[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest.

===Albedo as Negative Armodrillo===
[[Albedo|Negative]] Armodrillo resembles [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Armodrillo in '''Omniverse''', except his armor, eyes, and [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol are all colored red.

